+# Review rules
+
+These rules apply to each change in this repository. A review checks each of them.
+
+## Must fix
+
+1. Every endpoint that returns a list takes `limit` and `offset`. `limit` is 20 by default and at most 100. A `limit` below 1 or above 100, or a negative `offset`, is refused with 422 and an error on that field. The response has a count of all matching items next to the list.
+2. A response never contains the email address of a member, except the own account in `GET /api/user`.
+3. Each change to the database schema has a migration for SQLite and for SQL Server.
+4. Each new endpoint has integration tests for the success case and for each refusal.
+
+## Nits
+
+At most five nits for each review. A nit never blocks a merge.
